msgid ""
"<firstname>Nicolas</firstname> <surname>Goutte</surname> <email>goutte@kde."
"org</email>"
msgstr ""
"<firstname>Nicolas</firstname> <surname>Goutte</surname> <email>goutte@kde."
"org</email>"

#. Tag: trans_comment
#: index.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROLES_OF_TRANSLATORS"
msgstr "ULOGE_PREVODIOCA"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using the man ioslave you are able to read the man pages installed on your "
"system. It is easy to use:"
msgstr ""
"Koristeći man ioslave u mogućnosti ste da pročitate man stranice instalirane "
"na vašem sistemu. Lagano je za korištenje:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "See the sections of the manual, click to find the rest."
msgstr "Pogledajte poglavlja priručnika, kliknite da bi pronašli ostatak."

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>man:/</command><replaceable>fopen</replaceable>"
msgstr "<command>man:/</command><replaceable>fopen</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "See the man page of <command>fopen</command>."
msgstr "Pogledajte stranicu čovjek  <command>fopen</command>."

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>man:/</command><replaceable>fopen(3)</replaceable>"
msgstr "<command>man:/</command><replaceable>fopen(3)</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "See the man page of <command>fopen</command> in section 3."
msgstr "Pogledajte stranicu čovjek <command>fopen</command> u poglavju 3."

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>man:/</command><replaceable>(3)</replaceable>"
msgstr "<command>man:/</command><replaceable>(3)</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "See the index of section 3."
msgstr "Pogledajte indeks u poglavlju 3."

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>man:/</command>intro<replaceable>(3)</replaceable>"
msgstr "<command>man:/</command>intro<replaceable>(3)</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "See the introduction of section 3."
msgstr "Pogledajte uvod u poglavju 3."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If there are more than one man page of the name that you have entered, you "
"will get a list where you can choose the man page that you want to see."
msgstr ""
"Ako postoji više nego jedna man stranica imena kojeg ste unijeli, dobit ćete "
"listu gdje možete izabrati man stranicu koju želite vidjeti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is also a shortcut: <userinput><command>#fopen</command></userinput>, "
"which has the same effect as above."
msgstr ""
"Postoji i prečica: <userinput><command>#fopen</command></userinput>, koja "
"ima isti efekat kao gore navedeno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you do not find all your man pages, adjust the configuration file "
"<filename>/etc/manpath.config</filename> (or a file of a similar name "
"depending on your distribution) or adjust the environment variables "
"<envar>MANPATH</envar> and <envar>MANSECT</envar>."
msgstr ""
"Ako ne nađete sve stranice čovjeka, podesite datoteku konfiguracije  "
"<filename>/etc/manpath.config</filename> (ili datoteku koja ima slično ime "
"ovisno o vašoj raspodjeli) ili podesite okolinske varijable <envar>MANPATH</"
"envar>i <envar>MANSECT</envar>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As with any other &kde; ioslave, it is possible to enter a &URL;, like "
"<userinput><command>man:/socket</command></userinput> in <emphasis>any</"
"emphasis> &kde; application. Try it in &kwrite; and you will see the man "
"page in &HTML; format."
msgstr ""
"Kao i sa svakim &kde; ioslave, moguće je unijeti &URL; kao "
"<userinput><command>man:/socket</command></userinput> u<emphasis>any</"
"emphasis> &kde; aplikaciju. Pokušajte u &kwrite; i vidjet ćete da stranica "
"čovjeka u &HTML; formatu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Contact mailing list: <email>kde-devel@kde.org</email>"
msgstr "Kontaktiraj mailing listu:  <email>kde-devel@kde.org</email>"
